{"id":"n15611-2-7","stage":2,"title":"솟다 · 猛涨","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15611-2-7-1","ko":"기름값이 무서운 줄 모르고 솟네요.","zh":"油价涨得真吓人，简直没个头。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"기름값이","meaning":"油价、燃油费用","explanation":"기름값：油价、燃油费用；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"기름값","audio":"/audio/22cc502591fef87bc41e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:기름값:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"기름값","origin":"course-authored supplement"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기름값이","audio":"/audio/e3aed6597fddb570262b.mp3"}},{"text":"무서운","meaning":"厉害，惊人","explanation":"무섭다：厉害，惊人；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"무섭다","audio":"/audio/6c5692ebced898c0376c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55637","senseId":"3","lemma":"무섭다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무서운","audio":"/audio/18b93c56dfe071e33206.mp3"}},{"text":"줄","meaning":"所理解的情况（与 알다、모르다 等合用）","explanation":"줄：所理解的情况（与 알다、모르다 等合用）","readings":[{"term":"줄","audio":"/audio/4e04e3938cc9c67ed71b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91870","senseId":"1","lemma":"줄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"줄","audio":"/audio/4e04e3938cc9c67ed71b.mp3"}},{"text":"모르고","meaning":"不知不觉","explanation":"모르다：不知不觉；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"8","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모르고","audio":"/audio/09573e86c49a1672dd34.mp3"}},{"text":"솟네요.","meaning":"猛涨","explanation":"솟다：猛涨；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"솟다","audio":"/audio/e46d28463f746d9103c0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15611","senseId":"2","lemma":"솟다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"솟네요","audio":"/audio/44a6a9e50ee81bb0ddf9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"22cc502591fef87b","term":"기름값","zh":"油价、燃油费用","audio":"/audio/22cc502591fef87bc41e.mp3","definition":"购买燃油的价格或费用。","